    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the prompt. The prompt asks for \"a 15-second, 9:16 vertical video of a real vintage cinema character short, with low-saturation film aesthetics.\" \n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\nThe visuals are solid overall. The lighting, color grading, and cinematography deliver a convincing vintage cinema vibe with warm tones and deliberate grain. While there are occasional minor softness or slight noise in some frames, these do not significantly detract from the overall impression. The framing remains stable across shots, and the subject's silhouette and dress details stay clear. Overall, visual quality is strong but not flawless.\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\nThe video largely aligns with the prompt: it presents a female figure in period-appropriate attire within a vintage dance-hall setting, with a green dress and the intended atmosphere. However, there are a few moments where motion or framing could be more tightly synchronized with the described actions, resulting in a near-perfect alignment rather than an absolute one. The core elements—subject, setting, and aesthetic—are well captured.\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency:\nMovement and fabric behavior read as natural, with the dress responding plausibly to motion and lighting maintaining coherence throughout. There are no obvious physics violations, though very subtle timing nuances may exist that prevent a perfect score. Overall, physical consistency is solid.\n\nGround-truth scores (for reference): Visual Quality 4; Text-to-Video Alignment 4; Physical Consistency 4.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 4\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 4\n"
